{
  "about": "Every code theme, defined once. Swift reads this file as the CodeThemes resource (Packages/Theme); Rust compiles the same file in (crates/theme, include_str!). Colours are #RRGGBB or #RRGGBBAA in sRGB, straight alpha. Every theme names every palette and syntax role, and an unknown role fails both readers. Syntax roles read the colour the source theme gives each role's representative TextMate scope (docs/specs/2026-10-15-workbench-themes-decisions.md lists them). Provenance and licence sit beside each theme; NOTICE.md carries the MIT notices.",
