      "appearance": "dark",
      "provenance": {
        "source": "The house theme: the operator's terminal palette (charcoal #1D2022, ink #E4EEF5, amber #EAA35E, mint #75D5A1, and its ANSI colours), mapped onto syntax roles by us. Reds and magentas are lightened until every syntax colour reads at least 4.5:1 on the charcoal.",
        "licence": "Ours, under this repository's terms."
